  "description": "Client side of the RFC 9457 problem details contract produced by Rkd.Scalar. Reads error responses from any HttpClient (Blazor WebAssembly, Blazor Server, WPF, console apps and MCP servers, ASP.NET Core backends) into a single HttpProblem with status, code, title, detail, traceId and validation errors, tolerating non-standard responses (plain JSON, empty bodies, text or proxy HTML pages). No ASP.NET Core dependency, trimmable and AOT compatible.",
